<p class="note">Leave it running, then reload this page.</p></div>
<div class="card" id="runningbox" style="display:none">
<p><span class="ok">&#9679; Console is running.</span>
<form data-console="/shutdown" method="post" style="display:inline"
onsubmit="return confirm('Stop the console server?')">
<button type="submit" class="stop">Stop console</button></form></p></div>
<div class="card"><h2>2. Upload a module</h2>
<form data-console="/projects/new" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data">
